===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=to [[set]] [[aside]]|sets aside|setting aside|set aside}}

# {{transitive|idiomatic}} To [[separate]] and [[reserve]] something for a specific [[purpose]].
#: ''Plan to '''set aside''' three or four hours to see the museum.''
# {{transitive|idiomatic}} To [[disagree]] with something and [[reject]] or [[overturn]] it.
# {{transitive|idiomatic}} To declare something [[invalid]] or [[null and void]].

